{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
wrapped in light as [C]with a robe, [Bb]stretching out the heavens like a [Dm]tent.
He lays the beams of his [C]upper rooms on the [Bb]waters, makes the clouds his chariot, and [C]rides on the wings of the [Dm]wind.
